lking about here! Whether it be overcoming your own complicated feelings of love, or defeating your rival in a lovers quarrel showdown...the romance you always dreamed of having won't be obtained without a fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Love isn't all sunshine and rainbows...sometimes love can be hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Half Visual Novel, Half Bullet Hell</u></strong>: Love Hell, is a standard Visual Novel with Bullet Hell sequences intertwined with the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Enter the Battle Arena!</u></strong>: The Bullet Hell sequences are replayable once unlocked through the story via the main menu. Try new loadouts, and shoot for new high scores in the Battle Arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Post-Game Content!</u></strong>: Once you complete the story, you will unlock the &quot;Extra Dates!&quot; game mode. This will give you new story content, introducing new character interactions between the cast to see what they're up to after the story ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Gallery and Dev Log!</u></strong>: Check out a collection of art from the game in the gallery, or learn more about the development of the game via the Dev Log!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Character Bios!</u></strong>: Learn more about each of the characters. What they like, don't like, and even things you probably don't even care to learn about! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong><u>Post-Release Content!</u></strong>: I plan on updating the game periodically with new &quot;Extra Dates!&quot; content. Check back regularly to see what the crew is up to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Cast</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903380/extras/MC_new2.PNG?t=1753064336\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903380/extras/Alice_new.PNG?t=1753064336\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903380/extras/Hideyoshi_new.PNG?t=1753064336\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903380/extras/Kimiko_new.PNG?t=1753064336\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903380/extras/Lord_Boros_new.PNG?t=1753064336\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Copyright</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some music used in the trailer is Royalty-Free. Credit given below:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<i>Epic Chase by MaxKoMusic </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Meat Grinder: Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CGs drawn by:</strong><br><i>ClartheLunagate / Maageriazette </i><br> </p>",
